@startuml
!include style.iuml
' UC-02 Run Readiness Check (M2). Built from activity_diagnostics.
' Code: Core/Readiness/ReadinessPolicy, Services/Readiness/ReadinessCheckService,
' DashboardViewModel.RunReadinessAsync / RetryReadinessItemAsync / ReportReadinessAsync,
' ExamsController.SubmitReadiness (recomputes the pass, ReadinessCheck row + audit, hub ReadinessUpdated),
' ReadinessValidity = 30 min.
' Practice branch: ExamDashboard PracticeButton_OnClick (list of IsMock exams, start-session gives a fresh
' attempt after each submit, exam window in Report mode without webcam; ungraded, excluded from stats).
' Plain labels: limits, endpoint and event names are left out.
' Large font at dpi 96. Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowFontSize 24
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 25
}

|Student|
|Desktop App|
|Server|
|Student|
start
if (Run check
or Practice?) then ([Practice])
  :Pick a practice
  exam, press Practice;
  |Server|
  :Start a new attempt
  (ungraded, any
  number of tries);
  |Student|
  :Answer in the exam
  window (apps only
  reported, no webcam),
  submit;
  stop
else ([Run check])
  (A)
  detach
endif
|Desktop App|
(A)
:Load the exam's
requirements;
:Run 7 checks: network,
clock, screen capture,
camera*, microphone*,
secure mode, disk space
(* only if the exam
needs it);
:Send the results;
|Server|
:Check the results again,
save them, log them,
update the live monitor;
|Desktop App|
:Show the result
of each check;
if (All needed\nchecks passed?) then ([no])
  |Student|
  :Fix the problem,
  press Retry;
  (A)
  detach
else ([yes])
  |Desktop App|
  :Show "All checks
  passed" (valid
  for 30 min);
  stop
endif
@enduml
